+## Shadows
+
+- Description: Controls individual shadows in the user interface.
+- Setting: `shadows`
+Open the Settings Editor and choose **Edit in settings.json**. Configure these
+shadow options in JSON.
+
+- Default:
+
+```json [settings]
+{
+  "shadows": {
